cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or its classifications, please cite it as below."
title: "Clinical Trial Failures: stopped clinical trials classified by why they stopped"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Yousefian
    given-names: Schayan
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23558833"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ThorfinnThor/oncology-trial-failures"
url: "https://clinicaltrialfailures.com"
abstract: >-
  Terminated, suspended and withdrawn trials from ClinicalTrials.gov, classified by the
  sponsor's stated stop reason into biological failure signals (efficacy, futility, safety)
  and non-biological causes (recruitment, funding, strategy, regulatory), with the evidence
  span each label rests on. Completed Phase 2/3 trials are read for a missed primary endpoint.
  Rebuilt weekly.
keywords:
  - clinical trials
  - ClinicalTrials.gov
  - drug development
  - trial termination
  - clinical trial failure
